WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:03.190
Have you ever wondered what ●●|●●●●●|●●|● wants?

00:00:03.190 --> 00:00:09.240
Foundation staff snapped a picture of ●●|●●●●●|●●|● with
SCP-978, the Desire Camera, while it was standing

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:10.790
still, and this was the result:

00:00:10.790 --> 00:00:12.160
"A blank photograph with

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:15.129
●●|●●●●●|●●|●'s designation
written on it."

00:00:15.129 --> 00:00:19.470
Shortly after it was developed, ●●|●●●●●|●●|● stole
the photo before disappearing.

